        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_159_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for all you've done, Cohen, K\u00f6tz, Tina, Alexsandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "text": "On behalf of... The town of Long Spring...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I'm not so good with this kind of formal language.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks to you, I survived the conflict with my brother, and my people were able to return to live on their land.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were only doing what had to be done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "text": "We started this, so it's our responsibility to end it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_159_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it weren't for my irredeemable brother, none of this would've happened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "text": "I would have liked to offer you a reward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, as you can see, our town has been destroyed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anything we have left, I want used to rebuild Long Spring.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "text": "A cash reward... is beyond my power to give you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_159_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "But anything you may want from this home is yours to take.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think we will have to tear it all down and build a new Long Spring with the survivors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "About that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alexsandr?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_459_tachak_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This helmet fits well. Can I keep it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#6",
        "name2": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh huh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_457_blitz_1#5",
        "name2": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Really, the nail tips are so blindingly bright, I'd like to put one on my shield so I don't need batteries anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's enough for us. We're satisfied.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_159_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's... that's all?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "text": "My weapons, my father's heirlooms, you can\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "No thanks. You need them more than we do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_159_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_159_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Picale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_456_ash_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go. We should leave now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
