    },
    {
        "text": "Mister K\u00f6tz......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_155_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're finally done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you say goodbye to the Lord?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then it's time for us to go too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_167",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "My team will cover your return to Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stormeye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_167",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_167",
        "name2": "char_456_ash_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Cohen, your squad is coming with us, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stormeye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_167",
        "name2": "char_456_ash_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. We've been fighting too long. We need a place to rest and resupply.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "text": "And most importantly, we probably need some identities.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "text": "Identities we can go around the world with... around Terra.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_167",
        "name2": "char_456_ash_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stormeye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_167"
    },
    {
        "text": "The car's ready. We're off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stormeye"
    },
