    {
        "text": "So these are our new identities.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "At least I've got a shield I can use. Could be worse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do we have a plan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "Try to take a look at this world, which we now know too little about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd like to have a detailed writeup myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this time, I'm sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's all up to us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "text": "So where's our first destination?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Somewhere called Siesta. Sounds like a pretty good city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then let's get going.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Until we make it back home, we're on the road.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
